# Response

kpi Responded | 842 of 1,060 | 79.4% response rate | good

Thank you to everyone who took the time to answer.

kpi Average favorable | 66.2% | +1.2 pts on 65.0% in 2025 | good

# Results by statement

Percent of respondents who answered favorable, neutral or unfavorable.

chart hbar survey x=statement y=favorable,neutral,unfavorable stack unit=% title="Responses by statement"

table survey cols=statement,favorable,neutral,unfavorable heat=favorable

# Change since 2025

Favorable scores rose on four of five statements. The biggest gains are manager feedback and recommending the company, at 3 points each.

chart hbar change x=topic y=points unit=" pts" labels title="Change in favorable score since 2025"

!! The only decline is growth: "I see a path to grow here" fell 3 points, from 52 to 49. It is also our lowest score.

